// TEXT, ENCODING, UNICODE, CRYPTO and NUMERIC identities: evidence only. Each row records what
// the operation computes, under which authority (declared or merely required), and whether its
// refusals are modeled; the class is derived in gunbc.primitive_egress.disposition. That the seed
// realizes most of them in Rust today is a route fact carried on the census standing, not evidence.
